!appsettings.example.json
# The telematics edge's PRODUCTION CONFIG TEMPLATE must ship: install.sh copies it to
# /opt/opstrax/gateway and the script runs under `set -e`, so a missing file aborts a
# provisioning run midway. It is a template, not a filled-in config — it holds no secrets, and
# DeploymentHardeningContractTests fails the build if one is ever added. Both the HMAC secret and
# the outbox encryption key reach the gateway through the systemd EnvironmentFile instead.
!telematics/deploy/appsettings.Production.json
frontend/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
/package-lock.json
DEMO_CREDENTIALS.md
.render-secrets.generated

